sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A1 as Admin A
  actor A2 as Admin B
  participant BT as budget-treasury
  participant L as Readers
  A1->>BT: propose(Upgrade(wasm_hash))
  BT-->>L: proposal_created
  A2->>BT: approve(id)
  BT-->>L: contract_upgraded
  BT->>BT: update_current_contract(wasm_hash)
  Note over BT: Keeps its ID and storage.<br/>The constructor does not run again
